---
layout: base.njk
title: false
description: SecretChip builds practical security products and services. AEGIS PDNS delivers protective, encrypted DNS. Our vCISO service provides on-demand security leadership, governance, and compliance.
---

<section class="home-hero fade-up">
  <p class="eyebrow">SecretChip · Practical security</p>
  <h1>Security that's <span class="gradient-text">testable, deployable, and led</span>.</h1>
  <p class="lead">SecretChip builds practical security products and services. Protect your network with encrypted, policy-aware DNS, and lead your security program with on-demand executive expertise.</p>
  <div class="btnrow">
    <a class="btn primary" href="#products">Explore our products</a>
    <a class="btn" href="/contact/">Talk to SecretChip</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="products" class="section">
  {% set eyebrow = "What we offer" %}{% set heading = "Two ways to strengthen your security posture" %}{% set asH1 = false %}{% set desc = "A protective DNS product you can test and deploy today, and the security leadership to put it inside a real program." %}
  {% include "section-heading.njk" %}

  <div class="grid2" style="margin-top: 22px;">
    {% for p in site.products %}
      <div class="card product-card {{ p.key }}">
        <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px;">
          <span class="ico {% if p.key == 'aegis' %}blue{% else %}purple{% endif %}" aria-hidden="true">
            {% if p.key == 'aegis' %}◈{% else %}✦{% endif %}
          </span>
          <span class="product-tag">{{ p.tag }}</span>
        </div>
        <h3>{{ p.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ p.tagline }}</p>
        <ul class="checks product-feats">
          {% for pt in p.points %}<li>{{ pt }}</li>{% endfor %}
        </ul>
        <div class="btnrow">
          <a class="btn {% if p.key == 'aegis' %}primary{% else %}purple{% endif %}" href="{{ p.href }}">{{ p.ctaLabel }}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band section">
  <div class="band-inner">
    {% set eyebrow = "Why SecretChip" %}{% set heading = "Security you can reason about" %}{% set asH1 = false %}{% set desc = "We favor controls that can be validated in real environments over abstract promises." %}
    {% include "section-heading.njk" %}

    <div class="grid4" style="margin-top: 22px;">
      <div class="card"><h3>Testable</h3><p>Public canary domains, resolver modes, and clear deliverables mean you can verify what's happening instead of guessing.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Deployable</h3><p>Practical rollout paths for devices, routers, and fleets — and roadmaps your team can actually execute.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Transparent</h3><p>Visible filtering pipeline outputs and plain-language reporting. We say upfront what each engagement covers.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Led</h3><p>Experienced security leadership connects the product to governance, compliance, and board-level priorities.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  {% set eyebrow = "How it fits together" %}{% set heading = "Product plus leadership" %}{% set asH1 = false %}{% set desc = "Start wherever you are. AEGIS PDNS gives you a protective control today; vCISO makes sure it sits inside a strategy that holds up to scrutiny." %}
  {% include "section-heading.njk" %}

  <div class="grid3" style="margin-top: 22px;">
    <div class="card"><h3>Product-led</h3><p>Begin with AEGIS PDNS testing and deployment, then add leadership support when policy, scale, or compliance complexity appears.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Leadership-led</h3><p>Begin with a vCISO engagement to set strategy and governance, then adopt AEGIS PDNS as a prioritized protective control.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>Combined</h3><p>Run product and leadership together for faster implementation, cleaner handoff, and durable operating outcomes.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  {% set ctaTitle = "Tell us what you're protecting" %}
  {% set ctaText = "Bring your current constraints and target outcomes. We'll map a practical plan across AEGIS PDNS, vCISO, or both." %}
  {% set ctaPrimaryLabel = "Contact SecretChip" %}
  {% set ctaPrimaryHref = "/contact/" %}
  {% set ctaSecondaryLabel = "See solutions by audience" %}
  {% set ctaSecondaryHref = "/solutions/" %}
  {% include "cta.njk" %}
</section>
